00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:23.220
connection comes down to the fact that this sinc&nbsp;
function or the engineer sinc function with the pi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:27.720
on the inside is related to the rect function&nbsp;
using what's known as a Fourier Transform.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:32.160
Now if you've never heard of a Fourier Transform,&nbsp;
there are a few other videos on this channel all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:35.700
about it. The way it's often described is&nbsp;
that if you want to break down a function&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:39.960
